[{"title":"狮子山","author":"吴与弼","text":"狮子矶头一棹过，客边心事近如何。\n寒更往辙知非切，暖日遗编得意多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10484,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观语类后作","author":"吴与弼","text":"平生朱训不离绅，舟上微言月夜亲。\n又喜朱乡山水近，幸哉亦是及门人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10485,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"景德舟中","author":"吴与弼","text":"几展寒衾未忍眠，残灯旋剔又舒编。\n虽云甚矣吾衰也，一息犹存合勉旃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10486,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"至日","author":"吴与弼","text":"闭关旅食浮梁日，归梦寒更景德舟。\n天心见处从羲觅，物理窥时向邵求。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10487,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚起","author":"吴与弼","text":"道上行人系客心，灯花忽喜照更深。\n寒衾睡稳归怀好，今日良朋定盍簪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10488,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别旧生祈门谢复谢希林饶晋","author":"吴与弼","text":"今日良朋果盍簪，还家各务惜分阴。\n新春有约龙潭上，好与儿曹共此心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10489,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"发景德镇","author":"吴与弼","text":"十日窑头系客船，静中黄卷夜忘眠。\n开头正值阳来复，水色山光媚晚天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10490,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重经狮子山","author":"吴与弼","text":"阳复春来一棹还，简编新课日希颜。\n船头火伴时相命，掩卷推篷又看山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10491,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"独夜怀古","author":"吴与弼","text":"怀古心期孰与论，客边程课自朝昏。\n梅花溪上春光好，一味新功励子孙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10492,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鄱阳舟中伤九韶","author":"吴与弼","text":"时傍邻舟向日吟，天涯忽动故园心。\n始知一失钟生耳，宜绝当年伯氏琴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10493,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重宿磨刀石","author":"吴与弼","text":"缘岸人家富竹林，猗猗偏称客哦吟。\n若为觅得梅花伴，好结岁寒三友心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10494,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"煮粥禦寒","author":"吴与弼","text":"五更炊黍候行舟，端为霜严风更遒。\n但得寸心存养熟，自然天理日周流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10495,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"种湖比邻相劳","author":"吴与弼","text":"结伴归时正快哉，娟娟新月照吟怀。\n慇勤更辱邻舟问，何日重过故里来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10496,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿檐石","author":"吴与弼","text":"团团红日欲衔山，喜得乡人作伴还。\n系䌫汀沙回首处，饶河孤棹渺茫间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10497,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"灯花","author":"吴与弼","text":"晴色归程日向前，银灯花复照遗编。\n儿孙接处无他喜，往复新诗三十篇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10498,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿鱼门","author":"吴与弼","text":"梦里光阴一掷梭，壮怀偏感旧游多。\n昂藏空有男儿志，满鬓秋霜奈若何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10499,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴氏会景楼","author":"吴与弼","text":"东去书程日有功，西归临眺更从容。\n两间真意无穷外，一点虚灵变态中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10500,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿渐岭","author":"吴与弼","text":"俛仰浮生一转蓬，不眠兴绪月明中。\n茫茫尽是迷途辙，碌碌何时得反躬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10501,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠吴玺北归","author":"吴与弼","text":"两旬高谊动人多，又共西归信宿歌。\n记得桂林分手语，龙潭春色早相过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10502,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿打石港","author":"吴与弼","text":"读书有益专心晚，克己无功积悔多。\n从此更加鞭策力，馀生一味致中和。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10503,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即事","author":"吴与弼","text":"行李初从千里回，尘窗旋扫养灵台。\n微言玩罢更何事，时向溪头访早梅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10504,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题程希善梅月","author":"吴与弼","text":"旧馆多情坐夜阑，清晨梅月为谁寒。\n载瞻负荷孜孜处，玉殿承恩始拜官。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10505,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽李章","author":"吴与弼","text":"平生积学未经施，玉折徒增士友悲。\n存顺没宁男子事，晨窗慰尔五峰诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10506,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重宿连樊桥胥氏","author":"吴与弼","text":"连樊桥畔重投装，清夜迢迢故意长。\n楼阁玲珑春满眼，梅花新句赋晨窗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10507,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重宿下窑寺","author":"吴与弼","text":"暝色忙冲倦客旋，寒灯又宿下窑禅。\n忆从天上归来日，明月清霜夜半船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10508,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次集庆亭诗韵","author":"吴与弼","text":"偶共朋游话五峰，乃知世上有豪雄。\n但怜南北云泥迥，徒向青霄仰下风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10509,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉寄李学士","author":"吴与弼","text":"曾向韶华惜寸阴，直期心契古人心。\n竟无定力胜尘鞅，空有虚名玷士林。\n书为病来荒素业，诗因老去倦长吟。\n如何黄阁仍留念，白雪阳春辱远临。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10510,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓枕作","author":"吴与弼","text":"德性难驯学力微，空怜蘧瑗晚知非。\n从今何以酬馀齿，博约须令莫暂违。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10511,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄秦参政","author":"吴与弼","text":"净几明窗尚友轩，道情诗思共悠然。\n春宵几度相思梦，霁月光风各一天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10512,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小儿初度","author":"吴与弼","text":"家幸平康为乐天，世遵清白矢心坚。\n园林百果春如海，几阁群书日似年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10513,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠别程庸牛演","author":"吴与弼","text":"云南万里正新任，赣上千山复旧官。\n武略共瞻中土重，文韬总喜远隅安。\n壶浆柳柏春风软，灯火芸窗夜雨寒。\n慎勿轻为儿女态，功名留与后人看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10514,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"下窑寺赠牛演","author":"吴与弼","text":"晴山联骑度花阴，驻勒频倾故旧心。\n彼美禅关清夜宿，玉壶春酒又同斟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10515,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿桂家洲","author":"吴与弼","text":"疾风吹浪蹴云浮，捩柁停桡泊桂洲。\n巨舫得依深系䌫，孤篷高枕夜无忧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10516,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴氏南轩","author":"吴与弼","text":"寝息随时忘陆沉，银笺挥罢自长吟。\n庭前花草宜人处，生意新沾雨露深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10517,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"枕上偶成","author":"吴与弼","text":"静夜迢迢客梦回，高吟清兴正悠哉。\n窥窗更喜银河烂，定有晴光烛九垓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10518,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重宿九莲寺","author":"吴与弼","text":"曾寓禅房十日居，重来不见旧时书。\n閒窗一榻春宵梦，细忆流年二纪馀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10519,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"分枇杷丝头柑归种","author":"吴与弼","text":"晓露春泥斸石苔，远分苍翠入云哉。\n灵根细沃南归处，杖策扶儿日日来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10520,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜兴","author":"吴与弼","text":"昼寝房中应接稀，青灯夜雨独吟时。\n但令心广身长泰，不管东皋归去迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10521,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜晴","author":"吴与弼","text":"极目长天宿雨收，客窗春兴转悠悠。\n满庭花草同人意，流水行云任去留。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10522,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大司成颐庵先生二郎君怀珠玉下顾次韵奉酬","author":"吴与弼","text":"客窗重笃弟兄忱，竹树交加午院深。\n喜极翻令清泪堕，凄风折尽百年心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10523,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓枕","author":"吴与弼","text":"一榻平安客虑稀，梦回春漏正迟迟。\n东阡西陌嬉游处，欹枕孤吟记此诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10524,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游园","author":"吴与弼","text":"杖策游园处，乘风坐沼时。\n生涯从淡淡，归计任迟迟。\n万事信随遇，一身当自持。\n熟思今古辙，至善是吾师。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10525,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对月","author":"吴与弼","text":"照日东升月，随缘北住人。\n寸心元似水，两鬓任如银。\n得失几无定，荣枯事有因。\n素谙名教旨，敢不日书绅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10526,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九莲寺南轩","author":"吴与弼","text":"食罢閒来对橘花，春风庭院寂无哗。\n浮云流水何心计，幽兴饶时即是家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10527,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对竹","author":"吴与弼","text":"生涯忘旅泊，出户又斜曛。\n雪槛沉吟久，青青对此君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10528,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即事","author":"吴与弼","text":"送别禅关话别迟，旧生重诵旧吟诗。\n相看霜鬓空衰谢，从古深功贵及时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10529,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客夜","author":"吴与弼","text":"徐步吟苔砌，遥空对塔灯。\n禅扃终日卧，病骨暂时轻。\n宠辱元无系，诗书素有情。\n心随身共止，庶以达吾生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10530,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"饶氏东阁","author":"吴与弼","text":"香南山上侨居日，金凤桥西小憩时。\n虚阁明窗清昼永，云笺留字更留诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10531,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即事","author":"吴与弼","text":"旧馆欣重宿，新晴惬令辰。\n尘纷无所系，花鸟自相亲。\n嘉惠诸生盛，清樽院主频。\n素闻亨困旨，贵在熟吾生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10532,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对雨书怀","author":"吴与弼","text":"形容虽老矣，踪迹任飘然。\n夏雨淹三市，春风忆九莲。\n观生时学易，习静日同禅。\n利用崇吾德，忘机不识圆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10533,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宝应杂诗 其一","author":"吴与弼","text":"萍梗何劳计，簟瓢且寓居。\n清心宜雨树，供病庆时蔬。\n身惫多便枕，神疲少近书。\n故人频问讯，吾道近何如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10534,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宝应杂诗 其二","author":"吴与弼","text":"随遇安时命，寻幽养性灵。\n登临多古意，讲诵有儒生。\n所贵知通塞，尤宜适寝兴。\n当为斯是理，不必计枯荣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10535,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宝应杂诗 其三","author":"吴与弼","text":"远近搏空翼，高低接树花。\n晓烟香正妙，新霁日初斜。\n积学如攻木，无谋似算沙。\n知非吾辈晚，堪鄙又堪嗟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10536,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宝应杂诗 其四","author":"吴与弼","text":"隐几焚香罢，巡檐待月来。\n客怀不落莫，诗兴颇悠哉。\n处世怜无赖，为儒愧匪才。\n先师去日远，蒙吝藉谁开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10537,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"睹桐林书屋","author":"吴与弼","text":"一简谆谆辱爱多，知君微恙少愆和。\n伫看勿药来新喜，重向桐林共放歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10538,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"橙","author":"吴与弼","text":"葱茜亭亭爱一橙，日供清趣映檐楹。\n明朝回首怀萍梗，记得沉吟此际情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10539,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶过北院","author":"吴与弼","text":"讲罢残经思已荒，徐经别院暂徜徉。\n静来春意君知否，昼寝房栊日正长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10540,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寝起","author":"吴与弼","text":"不堪人事日匆匆，老病惟便一味慵。\n徙倚閒庭高枕后，遥看西塔夕阳红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10541,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重过北院","author":"吴与弼","text":"幽僻禅房又独来，窗边襟抱静中开。\n薰风爽气飘晴幔，绿树浓阴转午台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10542,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"甥馆","author":"吴与弼","text":"端午怀甥馆，蒲觞两度斟。\n徘徊经茂草，谁共黍离情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10543,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初五日","author":"吴与弼","text":"宝应逢重午，甥门忆往年。\n形容愁里异，时序梦中迁。\n倚玉人何在，为箕事渺然。\n客窗吟不寐，展转曙钟天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10544,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"坐塍间看耕","author":"吴与弼","text":"出户频频候月升，扶筇款款看秋耕。\n世间万事惟勤好，只恐儿孙未我听。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10545,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新移蜜檀柑金橘皆已结实日供清趣","author":"吴与弼","text":"蜜柑二颗逢时雨，金橘盈枝更可人。\n借问山家那有此，新年分得下窑春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10546,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"饲鱼","author":"吴与弼","text":"碧沼澹怡神，遗编暂一伸。\n病躯何所事，时作饲鱼人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10547,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"纪梦","author":"吴与弼","text":"二妙联英清且閒，高踪那得到柴关。\n哦吟晓枕思君处，檐雨萧萧秋梦还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10548,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沼上独坐","author":"吴与弼","text":"病眼昏花少近书，时从碧沼坐观鱼。\n支颐细忆平生志，行止何能与道俱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10549,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自讼","author":"吴与弼","text":"平生立志在希颜，逸驾那知不易攀。\n馀生碌碌嗟何及，羞看青编凡圣关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10550,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"仙游山","author":"吴与弼","text":"访古馀情咏绿阴，金风满径涤烦襟。\n静观万物生生意，契我虚灵无事心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10551,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小憩下窑寺竹里","author":"吴与弼","text":"嶰谷沉沉足午凉，郤枝寂寂散秋香。\n会心不觉孤吟久，信是閒中日月长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10552,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"塔下小立候小儿辈","author":"吴与弼","text":"寝起乘风步屧迟，绿阴清昼独吟时。\n遥空极目青云表，乾鹊声声为阿谁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10553,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题凤桥书屋","author":"吴与弼","text":"众理森严尽在书，朝经暮史志何如。\n须将万事皆依理，先圣前贤定不迂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10554,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠余知州","author":"吴与弼","text":"昨日高谈听友琴，今朝细语向桐林。\n几时更遂龙潭约，净几明窗叙夙心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10555,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉寄旧侯鹤州周使君","author":"吴与弼","text":"英辞频辱贲荒墟，逆旅曾劳枉使车。\n闽峤阻深龟鹤远，时看玉佩与琼琚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10556,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和康节清风吟","author":"吴与弼","text":"长短高词播大篇，谁知妙处在无言。\n微凉一动烦歊外，流水桃花共杳然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10557,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梦黄季恒","author":"吴与弼","text":"别却安乐窝，远为羁旅客。\n梦我平生人，形容宛如昔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10558,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"饶贰令淡庵","author":"吴与弼","text":"解组归来老布衾，遐龄细和淡庵吟。\n菜根酽醋男儿事，车马轻裘故旧心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10559,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杏林清趣为过省躬题","author":"吴与弼","text":"昨夜东风动九垓，董林生意满根荄。\n欲知化育功深浅，细看娇红次第开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10560,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆家","author":"吴与弼","text":"小陂晴色映佳晨，和气融融近小春。\n遥想诸孙称庆处，相看俱念客边人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10561,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"分栖凤竹","author":"吴与弼","text":"吴氏南轩栖凤竹，雨馀膏沐带花分。\n明朝冉冉龙潭上，伫见千儿与万孙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10562,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]